 ],
 "text": "47 general-seat members for PP-251–PP-297 as of 2026-11-15. Four seats have by-election winners (PP-266, PP-269, PP-289, PP-290). For PP-269 and PP-289, subsequent election notifications and reporting supersede entries in the assembly directory that have not been updated; the published directory still marks PP-269 vacant and lists PP-289’s former holder. Term-start years are used where an oath date was not established."
}